<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>MediVault e-Clinic System</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css?v=20261105-6"></head>
<body>
<div id="app">
<section id="landingView" class="screen active">
<header class="top-brand landing-brand"><img class="brand-logo" src="assets/medivault-logo-cropped.jpg" alt="MediVault e-Clinic System"></header>
<main class="landing-main"><div class="eyebrow">MediVault e-Clinic System</div><h1>MediVault Hospital Management</h1><p class="lead">Connected care for healthier lives - support and guidance, every step of the way.</p>
<div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card" data-view="login"><div class="feature-icon blue">⌁</div><h2>Patient Care</h2><p>Manage appointments, medical records and medication tracking.</p></article><article class="feature-card featured-card" data-view="staff"><div class="feature-icon green">♧</div><h2>Staff Management</h2><p>Organise doctors, nurses and healthcare staff in one place.</p></article><article class="feature-card" data-view="login"><div class="feature-icon purple">◇</div><h2>Secure Access</h2><p>Role-based access, validation and responsible healthcare data handling.</p></article></div>
<div class="landing-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" data-view="login">Login</button><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-view="signup">Create Account</button></div><div class="quick-access">Quick Access: <button data-view="login">Login</button><span>|</span><button data-view="signup">Register</button></div></main></section>

<section id="loginView" class="screen soft-screen"><button class="back-link" data-view="landing">← Back to Home</button><main class="auth-wrap"><div class="auth-card"><img class="auth-brand-logo" src="assets/medivault-logo-cropped.jpg" alt="MediVault e-Clinic System"><h1>Welcome Back</h1><p class="auth-subtitle">Login to MediVault Hospital Management</p><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" data-login-method="email">✉ Email</button><button class="tab" data-login-method="phone">☎ Phone</button></div><div class="security-note">◈ <span>Secure authentication with role-based access and login monitoring.</span></div>
<form id="loginForm" novalidate><label id="loginIdentifierLabel">Email Address</label><input id="loginEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required><label>Password</label><input id="loginPassword" type="password" placeholder="Enter your password" required><div class="auth-buttons"><button class="outline-btn" type="button" id="sendCode">✉ Send Code</button><button class="outline-btn" type="button" id="faceId">◉ Secure Login</button></div><div class="remember-row"><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" id="rememberMe"> Remember Me</label><button type="button" id="forgotPassword" class="text-btn">Forgot Password?</button></div><button class="btn btn-primary full-btn" type="submit">Login</button><p id="loginMessage" class="form-message"></p></form><p class="auth-footer">Don't have an account? <button class="text-btn strong" data-view="signup">Sign Up</button></p></div><p class="secure-caption">Secure authentication for the MediVault e-Clinic System</p></main></section>

<section id="signupView" class="screen soft-screen"><button class="back-link" data-view="landing">← Back to Home</button><main class="auth-wrap"><div class="auth-card signup-card"><img class="auth-brand-logo" src="assets/medivault-logo-cropped.jpg" alt="MediVault e-Clinic System"><h1>Create Account</h1><p class="auth-subtitle">Register a new MediVault account</p>
<div class="tabs signup-tabs"><button class="tab active" data-role="Patient">Patient</button></div><form id="signupForm" novalidate><input type="hidden" id="signupRole" value="Patient"><div class="two-col"><div><label>First Name</label><input id="firstName" type="text" required></div><div><label>Last Name</label><input id="lastName" type="text" required></div></div><div class="two-col"><div><label>Email Address</label><input id="signupEmail" type="email" required></div><div><label>Phone Number</label><input id="signupPhone" type="tel" required></div></div><div class="two-col"><div><label>Date of Birth</label><input id="dob" type="date" required></div><div><label>Gender</label><select id="gender" required><option value="">Select</option><option>Female</option><option>Male</option><option>Other</option><option>Prefer not to say</option></select></div></div><label>Address</label><input id="address" type="text" placeholder="Residential address"><label>Emergency Contact</label><input id="emergency" type="tel" placeholder="Emergency contact number"><label>Password</label><input id="signupPassword" type="password" minlength="8" required><label>Confirm Password</label><input id="signupConfirm" type="password" minlength="8" required><label class="check-label terms"><input id="terms" type="checkbox" required> I confirm that the information provided is accurate.</label><button class="btn btn-primary full-btn" type="submit">Create Account</button><p id="signupMessage" class="form-message"></p></form><p class="auth-footer">Already have an account? <button class="text-btn strong" data-view="login">Login</button></p></div></main></section>

<section id="patientView" class="screen dashboard-screen"><header class="dashboard-header"><button class="dash-brand home-brand" type="button" data-view="landing" aria-label="MediVault home"><img src="assets/medivault-logo-cropped.jpg" alt="MediVault home"></button><nav><button class="nav-item" data-view="landing">Home</button><button class="nav-item active" data-panel="patientOverview">Overview</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="patientAppointments">Appointments</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="patientRecords">Medical Records</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="patientMedication">Medication</button></nav><div class="user-menu"><span class="avatar" id="patientAvatar">JD</span><span id="patientName">Patient</span><button id="patientLogout">Logout</button></div></header><main class="dashboard-content"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Patient Portal</span><h1>Patient Dashboard</h1><p id="patientWelcome">Your health overview.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary compact" id="bookAppointment">+ Book Appointment</button></div><div class="stats-grid"><article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-icon blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3.5" y="5" width="17" height="16" rx="2.5"/><path d="M8 3v4m8-4v4M3.5 10h17M8 14h3m-3 3h7"/></svg></span><div><small>Upcoming Appointments</small><strong id="patientApptCount">0</strong><span>Scheduled visits</span></div></article><article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-icon green" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8.2 4.5a5.2 5.2 0 0 1 7.3 0l4 4a5.2 5.2 0 0 1-7.3 7.3l-4-4a5.2 5.2 0 0 1 0-7.3Z"/><path d="m9 14 7-7M5.3 18.7a3.2 3.2 0 0 0 4.5 0"/></svg></span><div><small>Active Medications</small><strong id="patientMedCount">0</strong><span>Current treatment</span></div></article><article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-icon purple" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 3h7l5 5v13H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z"/><path d="M14 3v6h6M9 14h6m-6 4h6"/></svg></span><div><small>Medical Records</small><strong id="patientRecordCount">0</strong><span>Available records</span></div></article></div><div id="patientOverview" class="dash-panel active"><div class="dashboard-grid"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Upcoming Appointments</h2><p>Your scheduled visits</p></div><button class="text-btn" data-panel-link="patientAppointments">View all</button></div><div id="patientAppointmentsList" class="data-list"></div></article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Recent Medical Records</h2><p>Your latest health information</p></div><button class="text-btn" data-panel-link="patientRecords">View records</button></div><div id="patientRecordsList" class="data-list"></div></article></div></div><div id="patientAppointments" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>My Appointments</h2><p>Appointments linked to your patient account.</p></div></div><div id="patientAppointmentsFull" class="data-list"></div></article></div><div id="patientRecords" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Medical Records</h2><p>Clinical records available to you.</p></div></div><div id="patientRecordsFull" class="data-list"></div></article></div><div id="patientMedication" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Medication</h2><p>Current and previous medications.</p></div></div><div id="patientMedicationFull" class="data-list"></div></article></div></main></section>

<section id="staffView" class="screen dashboard-screen"><header class="dashboard-header"><button class="dash-brand home-brand" type="button" data-view="landing" aria-label="MediVault home"><img src="assets/medivault-logo-cropped.jpg" alt="MediVault home"></button><nav><button class="nav-item" data-view="landing">Home</button><button class="nav-item active" data-panel="staffOverview">Overview</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="staffPatients">Patients</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="staffAppointments">Appointments</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="staffCalendar">Calendar</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="staffRecords">Medical Records</button></nav><div class="user-menu"><span class="avatar green-avatar" id="staffAvatar">SM</span><span id="staffName">Staff Member</span><button id="staffLogout">Logout</button></div></header><main class="dashboard-content"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Staff Portal</span><h1>Staff Dashboard</h1><p>Manage patient care and clinic activity.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary compact" id="newPatient">+ New Patient</button></div><div class="stats-grid"><article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-icon blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 20v-1.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-5A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 2 18.5V20m7-9a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8Zm11 9v-1.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3-4.25M16 3.2a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.6"/></svg></span><div><small>Total Patients</small><strong id="totalPatients">0</strong><span>Registered patients</span></div></article><article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-icon green" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 10h18m-13 5h3m-3 3h7"/></svg></span><div><small>Appointments</small><strong id="totalAppointments">0</strong><span>Scheduled visits</span></div></article><article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-icon purple" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 3h7l5 5v13H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z"/><path d="M14 3v6h6M9 14h6m-6 4h6"/></svg></span><div><small>Medical Records</small><strong id="totalRecords">0</strong><span>Clinical records</span></div></article></div><div id="staffOverview" class="dash-panel active"><div class="dashboard-grid"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Today's Appointments</h2><p>Clinic schedule</p></div><button class="text-btn" data-panel-link="staffAppointments">View schedule</button></div><div id="staffAppointmentsList" class="data-list"></div></article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Patient Search</h2><p>Find patient records quickly.</p></div></div><div class="search-box"><span>⌕</span><input id="patientSearch" placeholder="Search by name, email or patient ID"><button class="btn btn-primary compact" id="searchPatients">Search</button></div><div id="patientResults" class="data-list"></div></article></div></div><div id="staffPatients" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Patient Management</h2><p>Search, insert, update and delete patient records according to permissions.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary compact" id="newPatient2">+ New Patient</button></div><div class="search-box"><span>⌕</span><input id="patientSearchFull" placeholder="Search patients"><button class="btn btn-primary compact" id="searchPatientsFull">Search</button></div><div id="patientTable" class="table-wrap"></div></article></div><div id="staffAppointments" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Appointments</h2><p>Review patient requests and approve appointments assigned to you.</p></div></div><div id="staffAppointmentsFull" class="table-wrap"></div></article></div><div id="staffCalendar" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title calendar-heading"><div><h2>Availability Calendar</h2><p>Check your booked visits and open appointment slots.</p></div><div class="calendar-controls"><button type="button" class="mini-btn" id="calendarPrev" aria-label="Previous month">←</button><strong id="calendarMonthLabel"></strong><button type="button" class="mini-btn" id="calendarNext" aria-label="Next month">→</button></div></div><div class="calendar-grid" id="staffCalendarGrid"></div><div id="calendarSelectedSlots" class="calendar-slot-detail"><p class="empty-state">Loading your calendar…</p></div></article></div><div id="staffRecords" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Medical Records</h2><p>Clinical records stored in MediVault.</p></div></div><div id="staffRecordsFull" class="table-wrap"></div></article></div></main></section>

<section id="adminView" class="screen dashboard-screen"><header class="dashboard-header"><button class="dash-brand home-brand" type="button" data-view="landing" aria-label="MediVault home"><img src="assets/medivault-logo-cropped.jpg" alt="MediVault home"></button><nav><button class="nav-item" data-view="landing">Home</button><button class="nav-item active" data-panel="adminOverview">Overview</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="adminStaff">Staff &amp; Availability</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="adminAppointments">Appointments</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="adminPatients">Patient Details</button><button class="nav-item" data-panel="adminAudit">Audit History</button></nav><div class="user-menu"><span class="avatar purple-avatar">AD</span><span id="adminName">Administrator</span><button id="adminLogout">Logout</button></div></header><main class="dashboard-content"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Administration</span><h1>Administrator Dashboard</h1><p>Coordinate clinic operations, access and appointment flow.</p></div></div><div id="adminOverview" class="dash-panel active"><div class="dashboard-grid"><article class="panel"><h2>Staff &amp; access</h2><p>Manage staff accounts, roles, departments and active status. Inactive clinicians are removed from patient booking choices.</p><button class="btn btn-secondary compact" data-panel-link="adminStaff">Manage staff</button></article><article class="panel"><h2>Appointments</h2><p>Review the clinic schedule and manage appointment status when operational changes are needed.</p><button class="btn btn-secondary compact" data-panel-link="adminAppointments">Review appointments</button></article><article class="panel"><h2>Clinic hours</h2><p>Patient booking uses weekdays, 09:00–17:00, in 30-minute slots. Staff calendars show reserved and open slots.</p></article><article class="panel"><h2>Audit history</h2><p>Administrative changes and recent login activity are available for operational review.</p><button class="btn btn-secondary compact" data-panel-link="adminAudit">View history</button></article></div></div><div id="adminStaff" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Staff Accounts</h2><p>Create clinician accounts, update department/title, or deactivate accounts.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary compact" id="adminNewStaff">+ Add Staff Member</button></div><div id="adminStaffTable" class="table-wrap"></div></article></div><div id="adminAppointments" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Appointment Oversight</h2><p>View patient and assigned clinician, then update operational status.</p></div><button class="mini-btn" id="adminRefresh">Refresh</button></div><div id="adminAppointmentsTable" class="table-wrap"></div></article></div><div id="adminPatients" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Patient Administrative Details</h2><p>Edit contact and demographic details. Clinical records remain clinician-managed.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary compact" id="adminNewPatient">+ New Patient</button></div><div class="search-box"><span>⌕</span><input id="adminPatientSearch" placeholder="Search patients"><button class="btn btn-primary compact" id="adminSearchPatients">Search</button></div><div id="adminPatientTable" class="table-wrap"></div></article></div><div id="adminAudit" class="dash-panel"><article class="panel full-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Administrative Change History</h2><p>Recent staff and appointment changes, plus sign-in activity.</p></div></div><div id="adminAuditTable" class="table-wrap"></div><h2>Recent Login Activity</h2><div id="adminLoginAuditTable" class="table-wrap"></div></article></div></main></section>
</div>
<div id="modalRoot"></div>
<script src="script.js?v=20261112-1"></script>
</body></html>
